ells, consistent with mycobacterial infection (e.g., tuberculosis) of the retroperitoneal tissue/lymph nodes. It is a good, diagnostic-quality slide.\n\nI'll keep it focused. The user already states they believe correct answer is yes. So I confirm.\n\nFinal response in English.",
